    "en": {
      "trackName": "Tuure-forms",
      "description": "Tuure-forms is a calm and beautifully crafted puzzle experience that explores form across every scale of existence.\n\nFrom tiny living organisms and delicate micro-structures, to the patterns of nature around us, and further into the vastness of space, each puzzle invites you to notice shape, structure, and connection.\n\nSolve image-based puzzles on your Apple Watch, iPhone, iPad, or Mac and unlock something special. Every completed puzzle becomes a living slideshow on your Apple TV. What you solve in your hands is later experienced on the big screen — a quiet gallery of forms you have restored.\n\nTuure-forms is designed for moments of focus.\nNo timers. No pressure.\nJust presence, curiosity, and the quiet satisfaction of bringing scattered pieces back into harmony.\n\nFeatures:\n• Relaxing image puzzles inspired by micro-life, nature, and space\n• Available on Apple Watch, iPhone, iPad, and Mac\n• Solve at your own pace\n• Every completed puzzle unlocks a matching Apple TV slideshow\n• Seamless progress across devices using iCloud\n• No ads, no stress, no noise\n• Available in 15 languages\n\nTuure-forms turns small moments of attention into something lasting. A puzzle solved during the day can become a calm, evolving backdrop in your home at night.\n\nThe images in Tuure-forms were created with the help of AI.\n\nSlow down. Solve. Unlock the small, the natural, and the infinite.",
      "releaseNotes": "Tuure-forms now speaks your language and is available in 15 languages. Dates follow your language settings.",
